erased_through_foreign_type.jux:17:13: [E0620] error: `pack` calls itself at an ever-larger type argument (polymorphic recursion), which is compiled by erasing the type arguments of every function and class on that cycle -- but `T` of `Crate` is bounded by `Rel<OnceLock<T>>`, which holds it inside `OnceLock<T>`, a foreign type whose shape the compiler does not know, so the erased value cannot be converted into it
